# mouse-look: from the menu, load the saved game the items session writes; the ` key turns
# mouse-look on, the mouse turns the view right and pitches it up, a click acts at the crosshair,
# and ` turns it off again
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
9000 key grave
9500 look 200 0
10500 look 0 -50
11500 click 160 100 left
13000 key grave
